CORE no-new-smt
main.c

^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
A cast from a vector to a scalar of the same size must be a bit-wise
reinterpretation of the vector, without the back-end ignoring it.
The incremental SMT back-end does not support floating-point or fixed-point
values.
